      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get the \"balance\" thing but it feels like a bit of a cop-out. if you're actually trying to teach them how the world works, wouldn't a curriculum that focuses on systemic issues be more \"effective\" at preparing them for reality? like, isn't ignoring the power struggles just giving them an incomplete or even false version of history?",
